athsf{Cls},\\quad\\kappa,\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(j,M\\in\\mathsf{Cls},\\quad\\kappa,\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^3\\)</span> (class-level scheme, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fc577c79c699e0c\" href=\"?note=0fc577c79c699e0c\" title=\"58-df-class-elementary-embedding\">58-df-class-elementary-embedding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\times V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\times V^2\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fc577c79c699e0c\" href=\"?note=0fc577c79c699e0c\" title=\"58-df-class-elementary-embedding\">58-df-class-elementary-embedding</a> 的显式类图关系；所有类初等性断言按该文件的元语言模式解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,M,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)